# This repository holds text only. Every binary artefact — the port gazetteer
# (SQLite) and the coastal tile archives (PMTiles) — is published as a GitHub
# *release asset*, never committed here, so a clone stays a few hundred
# kilobytes and the history never carries a rewritten gigabyte.
#
# The patterns below exist so that a mistaken `git add` of an artefact is at
# least stored verbatim rather than mangled by line-ending or diff heuristics;
# it should still be reverted and published as a release asset instead.
*.sqlite  binary
*.pmtiles binary
*.pbf     binary
*.md      text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
